      "end": 5405.6,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5400.0,
      "text": "他跟吴征吃過兩次飯之後 我知道中國人的邪惡"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.368271,
      "compression_ratio": 1.392453,
      "end": 5409.7,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5405.6,
      "text": "用什麽話都沒法形容 他說是祖傳級的"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.368271,
      "compression_ratio": 1.392453,
      "end": 5413.4,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5411.2,
      "text": "他外國人永遠不會懂中國人的邪惡"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.368271,
      "compression_ratio": 1.392453,
      "end": 5419.1,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5413.4,
      "text": "吴征這個撒謊的本事 他說你服了 我在屋裏給他吃飯"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.368271,
      "compression_ratio": 1.392453,
      "end": 5423.9,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5419.5,
      "text": "他出去打電話去了 打電話說你看我跟陳水扁在一起呢"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.368271,
      "compression_ratio": 1.392453,
      "end": 5429.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5424.3,
      "text": "陳水扁派了這個圖誰誰誰 比如說文保老奶奶跟我征來吃飯"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.298088,
      "compression_ratio": 1.312741,
      "end": 5435.2,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5429.0,
      "text": "就是臺灣某某集電的董事長夫人 在哪個房間吃飯呢"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.298088,
      "compression_ratio": 1.312741,
      "end": 5437.5,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5435.2,
      "text": "陳水扁一會兒過來在隔壁見面"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.298088,
      "compression_ratio": 1.312741,
      "end": 5440.9,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5437.8,
      "text": "他說陳水扁來了我都嚇跑了"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.298088,
      "compression_ratio": 1.312741,
      "end": 5443.7,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5440.9,
      "text": "他說待會兒又出去打電話去了"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.298088,
      "compression_ratio": 1.312741,
      "end": 5448.3,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5443.7,
      "text": "他說首長已經搞定 陳水扁全部打應了 瞧姐"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.298088,
      "compression_ratio": 1.312741,
      "end": 5452.8,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5448.3,
      "text": "他沒想到臺灣這大姐是乾嘛啊"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.298088,
      "compression_ratio": 1.312741,
      "end": 5458.6,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5452.8,
      "text": "人家是人自己家俱樂部 你幹啥人都聽著都錄著呢"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.32262,
      "compression_ratio": 1.241228,
      "end": 5464.8,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 5458.6,
      "text": "就這大姐立馬給他 人家旁邊秘書告訴他說這小子說了什麼"
